{"1693940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TrackShot", "steam_appid": 1693940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/106ea2614cbf11444fbf56d15d42a34d.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Flyby of FFA battle\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/106ea2614cbf11444fbf56d15d42a34d.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/106ea2614cbf11444fbf56d15d42a34d.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TrackShot is a fast-paced tank PvP game where doing tricks earns you ammo. Grind rails, perform some flips, and land clean to load your shells, then fire them at your mates. Battle it out across a bunch of arenas and modes as you compete for air superiority.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise and grind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump half pipes, grind rails, and chain together sick aerials. Land clean for big ammo and boost payouts. Crash on the way down? Too bad, bozo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/9c97288be8a1b6ad6b994154cc4ed765.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Smooth chain of tricks\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/9c97288be8a1b6ad6b994154cc4ed765.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/9c97288be8a1b6ad6b994154cc4ed765.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get the jump on your enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free aim or aim down sights, on the ground or mid-air. Know where they'll land before they do, and shoot your shot. Lob shells across the map, blast tanks clean off their rails, and forget to watch where you're going as you drive straight off the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/30153a3c679a6cf732cc9a7aed3463be.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Jump ADS Kill\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/30153a3c679a6cf732cc9a7aed3463be.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/30153a3c679a6cf732cc9a7aed3463be.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also blow up a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/c7d387d53934b0fcdd36375a133f1590.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Blown up on rail\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/c7d387d53934b0fcdd36375a133f1590.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/c7d387d53934b0fcdd36375a133f1590.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything else</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-all and team modes across a handful of arenas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots that are much, much better at this game than you could ever be (I'm working on it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice against them offline, or let them fill out a lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in the garage and customize your tank with a variety of models, colors, boost effects, and more.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/106ea2614cbf11444fbf56d15d42a34d.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Flyby of FFA battle\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/106ea2614cbf11444fbf56d15d42a34d.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/106ea2614cbf11444fbf56d15d42a34d.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TrackShot is a fast-paced tank PvP game where doing tricks earns you ammo. Grind rails, perform some flips, and land clean to load your shells, then fire them at your mates. Battle it out across a bunch of arenas and modes as you compete for air superiority.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise and grind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump half pipes, grind rails, and chain together sick aerials. Land clean for big ammo and boost payouts. Crash on the way down? Too bad, bozo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/9c97288be8a1b6ad6b994154cc4ed765.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Smooth chain of tricks\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/9c97288be8a1b6ad6b994154cc4ed765.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/9c97288be8a1b6ad6b994154cc4ed765.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get the jump on your enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free aim or aim down sights, on the ground or mid-air. Know where they'll land before they do, and shoot your shot. Lob shells across the map, blast tanks clean off their rails, and forget to watch where you're going as you drive straight off the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/30153a3c679a6cf732cc9a7aed3463be.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Jump ADS Kill\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/30153a3c679a6cf732cc9a7aed3463be.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/30153a3c679a6cf732cc9a7aed3463be.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also blow up a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/c7d387d53934b0fcdd36375a133f1590.poster.avif?t=1785415003\" aria-label=\"Blown up on rail\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/c7d387d53934b0fcdd36375a133f1590.webm?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/extras/c7d387d53934b0fcdd36375a133f1590.mp4?t=1785415003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything else</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-all and team modes across a handful of arenas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots that are much, much better at this game than you could ever be (I'm working on it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice against them offline, or let them fill out a lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in the garage and customize your tank with a variety of models, colors, boost effects, and more.</p>", "short_description": "TrackShot is a fast-paced tank PvP game where doing tricks earns you ammo. Grind rails, perform some flips, and land clean to load your shells, then fire them at your mates. Battle it out across a bunch of arenas and modes as you compete for air superiority.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/43bff9db66ceeeb4bbaf73fcc1f860bb4d5aa214/header.jpg?t=1785415003", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/f40db12b82384c2e3054185a2da17af503db3eda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785415003", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693940/f40db12b82384c2e3054185a2da17af503db3eda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785415003", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><